are alternate on both surfaces and are spaced unequally (Fig. 2 B), they are also narrow-undepressed on the upper surface and broad-depressed on the lower surface. The rolled part of the apical portion shows 2 layers of cells (Fig. 2 C), while the median and basal portions feature a mixture of 2 – 3 cell layers, since some cells divide transversally (Fig. 2 D, E). In the 2 - layered region, the cells of the upper side are twice as high as those of the lower side (Fig. 2 C), while in the 3 - layered region portion, all three layers show the same height (Fig. 2 D, E). In our samples, no reproductive traits were found.","","text","",""]]},"KW3BN":{"d":[["Bihar","48186","mrgid","",""]]},"KZHNJ":{"d":[["Austria","47970","mrgid","",""]]},"KZSX5":{"d":[["Madeira","","text","native",""]]},"L23NF":{"d":[["MG","MG","iso","",""]]},"L5TBN":{"d":[["Distribution. Malaysia: Pahang.","","text","",""]]},"L9LFN":{"d":[["DISTRIBUTION. Ivory Coast, Tanzania, [England, under glass].","","text","",""]]},"LG2PP":{"d":[["Palaearctic","","text","native",""]]},"LGND":{"d":[["Europe & Northern Asia (excluding China)","","text","",""]]},"LS6P":{"d":[["Mexico (Chihuahua, Sonora)","","text","",""]]},"LSL8B":{"d":[["","TUR","tdwg","",""]]},"LZQWW":{"d":[["Distribution: Mediterranean.","","text","",""]]},"M4QGL":{"d":[["Africa","","text","",""]]},"MD9GT":{"d":[["North America","","text","",""]]},"MKNGX":{"d":[["Norway","NO","iso","",""]]},"MRPNH":{"d":[["Middle America","","text","",""],["South America","","text","",""]]},"MT22":{"d":[["Burkina Faso","","text","native",""],["Burundi","","text","native",""],["Cameroon","","text","native",""],["DR Congo","","text","native",""],["Djibouti","","text","native",""],["Eritrea","","text","native",""],["Guinea","","text","native",""],["Ivory Coast","","text","native",""],["Rwanda","","text","native",""],["Senegal/ Gambia","","text","native",""],["Sudan","","text","native",""]]},"MVWSX":{"d":[["","CLC","tdwg","",""]]},"N6K6":{"d":[["Australia","","text","",